 29 |       0 | GEOMETRYCOLLECTION |        2 | f       | f       | f          |          2 | f
 30 |       0 | POINT              |        3 | t       | f       | t          |          0 | f
 31 |       0 | POINT              |        2 | f       | f       | f          |          1 | f
 32 |       0 | POINT              |        2 | f       | f       | f          |          1 | f
